---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout 
	title="diceforce IT | Disclaimer" 
	description="Read the professional disclaimer for diceforce IT LLC. Understand limits of liability and information accuracy."
	activePage="none"
>
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-col gap-12 pt-10 pb-20">
		<!-- Page Header -->
		<section class="space-y-4 animate-stagger-item">
			<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 border border-white/5 rounded-full bg-white/[0.01]">
				<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400/80 uppercase">Limitation of liability</span>
			</div>
			<h1 class="font-syne font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl tracking-tighter leading-none text-white select-text">
				Disclaimer
			</h1>
			<p class="text-neutral-500 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">
				Last Updated: July 10, 2026
			</p>
		</section>

		<!-- Content Blocks -->
		<section class="border-t border-white/5 pt-12 space-y-12 animate-stagger-item font-light leading-relaxed text-neutral-300">
			<!-- Section 1 -->
			<div class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					1. Website Information Disclaimer
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					The information provided by diceforce IT LLC ("we", "us", or "our") on our website is for general informational purposes only. All information is provided in good faith, however we make no representation or warranty of any kind, express or implied, regarding the accuracy, adequacy, validity, reliability, availability, or completeness of any information on the site.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 2 -->
			<div class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					2. Professional Advice Disclaimer
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					The site cannot and does not contain specific technology consulting or recruiting advice. The technological, architectural, or MLOps details represent examples of studio capacity. The use or reliance of any information contained on this site is solely at your own risk.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 3 -->
			<div class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					3. External Links Disclaimer
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					Our site may contain links to external web resources, templates, Framer projects, or third-party integrations. Such external links are not investigated, monitored, or checked for accuracy, adequacy, validity, reliability, availability, or completeness by us. We do not warrant, endorse, guarantee, or assume responsibility for the accuracy of any information offered by third-party websites.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 4 -->
			<div class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					4. Technology & Model Output Disclaimer
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					Model parameters, neural response times, and machine learning performance details listed on our systems represent tests in calibrated sandboxes. Real-world project performance may vary based on model versions, hardware specifications, data quality, and network configurations.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- CTA / Back button -->
			<div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
				<p class="text-neutral-500 text-xs">
					Need more clarification? Contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@diceforceit.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">hello@diceforceit.com</a>.
				</p>
				
				<div class="relative group transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.015]">
					<div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0377ff] via-[#00deff] to-[#883ae2] rounded-full blur-md opacity-25 group-hover:opacity-60 transition-all duration-500 ease-out"></div>
					<div class="relative rounded-full p-[1px] overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center bg-black">
						<div class="absolute inset-[-200%] bg-[conic-gradient(from_0deg,#0377ff,#00deff,#883ae2,#00deff,#0377ff)] animate-border-spin"></div>
						<a 
							href="/home" 
							class="relative px-8 py-3 bg-black hover:bg-neutral-900 text-white font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-full transition-all duration-300 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer z-10 select-none group-hover:text-[#00deff]"
						>
							Back to Experience
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
